          "locator": "page:5",
          "text": "NORTHBRIDGE SYNTHETIC GROUP\nComplete facility and classification schedule\nPublished January 10, 2026. USD millions; consolidated group; IFRS carrying values.\nThere is exactly one debt facility: Northbridge Term Loan, facility_id term-loan.\nIt is a senior secured term loan, not a lease. No other debt facilities or debt adjustments exist.\nDate                 Carrying value  Principal  Drawn amount  Commitment\n2024-12-31           45              45         45            50\n2025-03-31           46.25           46.25      46.25         50\n2025-06-30           47.5            47.5       47.5          50\n2025-09-30           48.75           48.75      48.75         50\n2025-12-31           50              50         50            50\nThe carrying value equals principal and drawn amount; there are no fees, unamortized adjustments or other carrying-value adjustments.\nThe facility has floating rate type with SOFR reference rate, spread 0 basis points and floor 0 basis points. Fixed coupon is not applicable. Mandatory annual amortisation is 0; final maturity is December 31, 2029. Cash interest amounts in the quarterly statements are reported cash payments, not a forecast calculation from the terms.\nNo leases, unsecured debt, revolving commitments or revolving drawings exist at any reporting date.\nReported EBITDA equals revenue less total operating expenses including depreciation plus depreciation and amortization. Adjusted EBITDA equals reported EBITDA because there are no adjustments.\nCFO equals net profit plus depreciation and amortization plus the signed working-capital cash movement.\nNet cash change equals operating cash flow plus net investing cash flow plus net financing cash flow.\nCash movement equals closing cash less opening cash. Debt movement equals net cash debt issuance with zero noncash change."
